title: A World Falls
subtitle: The Separatists break through.
tags: event
view-if: world_fall_ready = 1 and war and not game_ending
priority: 6
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_war.svg
on-arrival: {! SW.worldFalls(Q); !}

= [+ world_fall_name +] Falls

The droid armies have broken through on [+ world_fall_front_name +]. [+ world_fall_name +], loyal to the Republic for a thousand years, is under Separatist occupation, and its senators have fled to Coruscant. The HoloNet shows the refugee ships, and asks where the Jedi were.

[? if coruscant_falls : With Alderaan lost, nothing stands between the Confederacy's fleets and Coruscant. ?]
